{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33321","headline":"戍卒伤春 · 于濆","name":"戍卒伤春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连年戍边塞，过却芳菲节。\n东风气力尽，不减阴山雪。\n萧条柳一株，南枝叶微发。\n爲带故乡情，依依籍攀折。\n晚风吹碛沙，夜泪啼乡月。\n凌烟阁上人，未必皆忠烈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}